				"id": 25222,
				"title": "Overview",
				"body_text": "Granyth assaults players with earthen powers. Upon reaching 100 energy, he attempts to crush his foes with a massive, ongoing [Eruption].",
				"sections": [
					{
						"id": 25223,
						"title": "Tanks",
						"body_text": "$bullet;[Eruption] inflicts more and more damage to all players until it is interrupted.\r\n$bullet;[Tectonic Stomp] inflicts high Nature damage to nearby players and knocks them away."
					},
					{
						"id": 25224,
						"title": "Damage Dealers",
						"body_text": "$bullet;[Tectonic Stomp] inflicts high Nature damage to nearby players and knocks them away.\r\n$bullet;Nokhud Saboteurs attempt to [Dismantle] Dragonkiller Lances to prevent them from firing.\r\n$bullet;Shikaar Lancers can be instructed to fire the [Dragonkiller Lance]."
